::Q001::[markdown]Which Principal Part of παιδεύω is ‘παιδεύσω’?:{
	~%-100%5th#Incorrect. **παιδεύσω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **παιδεύω**, not the 5th.
	~%-100%3rd#Incorrect. **παιδεύσω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **παιδεύω**, not the 3rd.
	~%-100%6th#Incorrect. **παιδεύσω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **παιδεύω**, not the 6th.
	~%-100%1st#Incorrect. **παιδεύσω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **παιδεύω**, not the 1st.
	~%100%2nd#Correct: **παιδεύσω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **παιδεύω** (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%4th#Incorrect. **παιδεύσω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **παιδεύω**, not the 4th.
}


