	~%-100%ἀκούω#Incorrect. **ἀκούω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἀκούω** “hear (+ acc. of thing)” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%ἥκω#Incorrect. **ἥκω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἥκω** “have come” (Chapter 8).
}


